   "date": "2026-10-06T18:28:45-05:00",
   "body": "Ideally you start with [npc=272046], then [npc=272044] and finish with [npc=272034]. If you kill the mob in the middle first, you're going to be backtracking a lot.\r\n\r\n[ul][li][b]Arysa[/b] heals and casts Lightning Bolts. Save your interrupts for the heal.[/li]\r\n[li][b]Gaedress[/b] casts a 4 second stun, but it can be outranged by simply walking back a few steps.[/li]\r\n[li][b]Hatescreech[/b] uses a berserk-type ability increasing their attack speed by 20%. Burst them down at this stage.[/li][/ul]\r\n\r\nThe [object=6752] near Arysa only starts a [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=931/the-shimmering-frond#map]quest[/url] if you've already finished [quest=918] and [quest=919].",
